# 4. Connection

## Purpose

Represents an approved trading relationship between one Pharmacy and one Stockist.

## Owner

Joint business relationship.

Initiation may come from Pharmacy request; approval ownership sits with Stockist.

## Participants

- Pharmacy
- Stockist

## Required Fields

- Pharmacy Business
- Stockist Business
- Connection Status
- Requested At
- Requested By

## Optional Fields

- Request Message
- Approval Notes
- Rejection Reason
- Customer-Specific Pricing Flag
- Credit Terms
- Preferred Delivery Settings
- Disconnection Reason

## Relationships

- Links exactly one Pharmacy and one Stockist
- Enables Orders between the pair
- Enables catalogue visibility according to rules
- Enables invoicing and payments between the pair

## Valid Statuses

- Requested
- Active
- Rejected
- Blocked
- Disconnected

## Allowed Actions

- Request connection
- Cancel request (before decision)
- Approve request
- Reject request
- Disconnect (where permitted)
- Block (where permitted)
- View connection details

## Forbidden Actions

- Order without Active connection
- Self-connection
- Duplicate active connection between the same pair
- Pharmacy approving its own request

## Lifecycle

```
Requested
    ↓
Active / Rejected
    ↓
Disconnected / Blocked
```

Active may move to Disconnected or Blocked.

## Business Rules

- Trading requires Active status.
- One active connection per Pharmacy–Stockist pair.
- Disconnecting must not delete historical Orders, Invoices, Payments, Returns, or Credit Notes.
- New orders are blocked when connection is not Active.
- In-flight orders at disconnection follow explicit edge-case rules.

## Audit Fields

- Requested At / By
- Approved At / By
- Rejected At / By
- Disconnected At / By
- Blocked At / By
- Reason History

## Derived Data

- Total Orders Between Pair
- Outstanding Balance Between Pair
- Last Trade Date

## Dependencies

- Both businesses verified and eligible to trade
- Distinct pharmacy and stockist identities

## Deletion Rules

- Connections are closed (Disconnected/Blocked), not erased.
- Historical relationship evidence remains.

## Visibility Rules

- Pharmacy and Stockist in the relationship can view the connection.
- Platform Administrator can view for dispute/governance.
- Unrelated businesses cannot view the connection.

