# 5. Product

## Purpose

Represents a medicine or healthcare product offered for trade by a Stockist.

## Owner

Stockist Business that created/listed the product.

## Participants

- Stockist (owner/manager of catalogue product)
- Connected Pharmacies (browse/purchase view)
- Platform Administrator (moderation if required)

## Required Fields

- Product Name
- Owning Stockist
- SKU / Stockist Product Code
- Unit of Measure
- Base Price
- Tax Category / GST Rate
- Availability Status
- Created At

## Optional Fields

- Generic Name
- Manufacturer Name
- Pack Size
- HSN Code
- Category
- Description
- Images
- MRP
- Discount Rules
- Minimum Order Quantity
- Maximum Order Quantity
- Prescription Category / Schedule
- Storage Conditions
- Barcode
- Tags

## Relationships

- Belongs to one Stockist
- Appears in one Product Catalogue
- Has many Batches
- Has Inventory records
- Appears on many Order Lines
- Appears on Invoice Lines
- May appear on Return Lines

## Valid Statuses

- Draft
- Active
- Inactive
- Out of Stock
- Discontinued

## Allowed Actions

- Create
- Edit (permitted fields)
- Activate / Deactivate
- Update pricing
- Update availability
- Discontinue
- View

## Forbidden Actions

- Delete product if historical transactions reference it
- Pharmacy editing stockist product master data
- Selling discontinued products on new orders
- Changing historical order line product identity

## Lifecycle

```
Draft
  ↓
Active ←→ Inactive / Out of Stock
  ↓
Discontinued
```

## Business Rules

- Product identity in historical documents must remain stable.
- Price shown at order time must be captured on the order line.
- Availability must consider batch-level sellable inventory.
- Same real-world medicine may exist independently per stockist.

## Audit Fields

- Created At / By
- Updated At / By
- Price Change History
- Status Change History

## Derived Data

- Available Quantity
- Reserved Quantity
- Nearest Expiry Date
- Active Batch Count
- Times Ordered

## Dependencies

- Owning Stockist must exist
- Tax category must be valid

## Deletion Rules

- Products with history are discontinued, not deleted.
- Catalogue removal hides from new browsing but preserves history.

## Visibility Rules

- Stockist sees full product master.
- Connected pharmacies see permitted catalogue fields and trade price according to connection/pricing rules.
- Unconnected pharmacies do not see private pricing.
- Platform Administrator may view for support/moderation.

