# 6. Product Catalogue

## Purpose

Represents the complete sellable product list owned by a Stockist.

## Owner

Stockist

## Participants

- Stockist users managing catalogue
- Connected Pharmacies browsing

## Required Fields

- Owning Stockist
- Catalogue Status
- Last Updated At

## Optional Fields

- Catalogue Name
- Import Reference
- Visibility Rules
- Notes

## Relationships

- Belongs to exactly one Stockist
- Contains many Products
- Referenced during Browse Catalogue and Place Order

## Valid Statuses

- Active
- Under Maintenance
- Inactive

## Allowed Actions

- Add products
- Remove products from active selling
- Import catalogue
- Export catalogue
- Publish updates

## Forbidden Actions

- Pharmacy modifying catalogue
- Deleting catalogue history tied to past orders
- Exposing catalogue to non-eligible pharmacies against visibility rules

## Lifecycle

```
Active ←→ Under Maintenance
   ↓
Inactive
```

