# 12. Delivery

## Purpose

Represents transportation of ordered/invoiced goods from Stockist to Pharmacy.

## Owner

Stockist (dispatch ownership)

Pharmacy participates in receipt confirmation.

## Participants

- Stockist fulfilment staff
- Delivery Boy / delivery staff
- Pharmacy receiving staff

## Required Fields

- Delivery Number
- Related Order (and/or Invoice as applicable)
- Pharmacy
- Stockist
- Delivery Status
- Delivery Address
- Created At

## Optional Fields

- Assigned Delivery Person
- Route
- Dispatch Time
- Expected Delivery Time
- Actual Delivery Time
- Received By Name
- Receipt Notes
- Proof of Delivery
- Partial Delivery Details

## Relationships

- Linked to Order
- May link to Invoice
- Contains delivered item quantities / batches
- Can enable Returns after successful delivery
- Affects Order status

## Valid Statuses

- Pending Assignment
- Assigned
- Out for Delivery
- Partially Delivered
- Delivered
- Failed
- Cancelled
- Returned to Stockist

## Allowed Actions

- Create dispatch
- Assign delivery staff
- Mark out for delivery
- Complete delivery
- Record partial delivery
- Record failure
- Confirm receipt
- View tracking

## Forbidden Actions

- Delivering without eligible packed/dispatched order state
- Editing completed delivery quantities without controlled correction flow
- Marking delivered without recording received reality when shortage/damage flow requires it

## Lifecycle

```
Pending Assignment
       ↓
Assigned
       ↓
Out for Delivery
       ↓
Partially Delivered / Delivered / Failed
       ↓
Returned to Stockist (from Failed where applicable)
```

## Business Rules

- Delivery completion does not equal payment completion.
- Delivered quantities become the basis for return eligibility.
- Partial delivery must record what was delivered.
- Failed delivery must not silently mark order delivered.

## Audit Fields

- Created At / By
- Assigned At / By
- Dispatched At / By
- Delivered At / By
- Failed At / Reason
- Receipt Confirmation At / By

## Derived Data

- Delivery Duration
- Success Flag
- Delivered Value
- Pending Quantity

## Dependencies

- Order in eligible fulfilment state
- Delivery address
- Allocated goods

## Deletion Rules

- Deliveries are not deleted after dispatch events; they are cancelled or completed with history.

## Visibility Rules

- Stockist and Pharmacy on the delivery can view.
- Assigned delivery staff can view assignment details needed for delivery.
- Platform Administrator can view.
- Others cannot.

